      "natural_statement": "The thirteen inventoried artifacts and all thirty-five versions of twenty-seven old claim ids are accounted for by three substantive mathematical units and one scope/map unit. Only the local shell reproduction, its strengthening/sharpness, and the two profile inequalities are submitted mathematical conclusions. Other manuscript-map assertions, finite expansion, nonscalar Poisson estimates, sieve, rigidity, publication novelty and all three global equidistribution theorems are not certified by these drafts.",
